// Deck Link v1: the agents deck over USB serial, for ESP32 boards and the
// like. The single source of truth for the Go daemon (protoc-gen-go) and the
// firmware kit (nanopb). docs/link/protocol.md explains framing, the
// handshake and every message; link.options sets the size limits both sides
// use (the deck clips longer text to them).
//
// Every message travels in a Frame. The board starts with Hello; the deck
// answers Welcome. Requests from the board carry a seq the deck echoes in its
// Result (or its typed reply); events from the deck have seq 0.

